<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara are imposing a N50 million levy on communities and declaring no-go zones ahead of the 2027 elections, while gunmen are repeatedly setting secondary schools ablaze in Plateau, including a school in Bokkos. In Gombe, Air Force personnel allegedly opened fire on civilians, causing deaths and injuries, and in Benue military forces rescued two abducted women. ISWAP suffered a major loss with a Shura Council member and top commanders killed as troops repelled an attack in Borno. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQZG5kNWlmcEZkU1FwejJfVUlPR3hKT3NqSngzMXBncG01NjhoUl9xUGs5V19yWGs5WDFJaE9qV01tZTM3aVZpOE5FOEVLQ1lCbDRSX0VXU1F4aVFjTUdJT1UyV0hTOFZtTzNvVFI1cnFWdnJFNWJLZGlDakFUVW1ZWkxKUkNZYVhVSEN5dDc3WXlqaGs0Q3d2QzdUUmR6QzlCTDhIeWVGT2VyZHRHODFGQWl1R0lidw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE83M0ZxUVA2SWdOQlFlT3Nmc0JvS0NiOERCX09Bc003RHVaOVNMaG9mR183Nkg2UXE0WVdmTnBZQXdmYkJpczJLZWxVSVJNb3RxOUlFYkxxWDhicEFvekVaQjlfTmhXVkIxcGpxVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNcnR3T2wyYkJORFhyaGVIVTdVOHdQcXUyekRYSDEzS1F1d21ibkFmS2VjbEFKajI4T0RDNDNtNmxIaG9wOFc0ZUhHUTd0eEVzYmh2UmhueDgweklIOE1oalEzMThhY1RBTDV3WFd4SmRxSVJkQmNMSlhpbi10cmxoSXZMQ2pxTGpyeXlTaTNialdGc0ItSy1DTTd6VWpoVVlwMllEWWtkRmdPdmotcnc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;zagazola.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNcTZhZ19PYlFYSjhqWXhIeUVsMUdaWWFWSTgyeE1kVERTeVRGMG1rUEluR1ltbWNzU3gxTy1xdU56ZUROZ3BSTkZkZVM1Z0lERjFKVm9PMzBZQ0ZXZTAyUG1MME1QM2dUOW5mZDBwWTg3bmY4bFpPMlVWS0M2UV8xd1MwczFUVlZGNjJWMUpjTlhFZ3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n